{"id":"informatsiya","lemma":"информация","pos":"noun","rank":733,"glosses":["information"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/5/5d/Ru-%D0%B8%D0%BD%D1%84%D0%BE%D1%80%D0%BC%D0%B0%D1%86%D0%B8%D1%8F.ogg/Ru-%D0%B8%D0%BD%D1%84%D0%BE%D1%80%D0%BC%D0%B0%D1%86%D0%B8%D1%8F.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"информации","plural":"информации"},"examples":[{"text":"Зачем вам эта информация?","en":"Why do you need this information?","words":[{"g":"why, what for"},{"g":"(to) you","l":"вы"},null,null]},{"text":"О какой информации вы говорите?","en":"Which information are you talking about?","words":[{"g":"about"},{"g":"what, what one"},null,{"g":"you (pl. / formal)"},{"g":"to speak, to talk","l":"говорить"}]},{"text":"Думаю, эта информация поможет.","en":"I think this information will help.","words":[{"g":"to think","l":"думать"},null,null,{"g":"to help","l":"помочь"}]},{"text":"Откуда у тебя эта информация?","en":"Where did you get this info?","words":[{"g":"whence, from where"},{"g":"at / by"},{"g":"you","l":"ты"},null,null]},{"text":"Я думаю, нам нужно больше информации.","en":"I think we need more information.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to think","l":"думать"},{"g":"(to) us","l":"мы"},{"g":"it is necessary"},{"g":"any more"},null]}]}